<!doctype lake><title>🕵️ 𝓟𝓸𝓼𝓲𝓽𝓲𝓸𝓷</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="zEpBv" id="zEpBv" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ue7c1bdbb" id="ue7c1bdbb">🎥</span><span data-lake-id="ud8043e35" id="ud8043e35"> 𝐑𝐨𝐅𝐨𝐫𝐦𝐞𝐫: 𝐄𝐧𝐡𝐚𝐧𝐜𝐞𝐝 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐬𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐦𝐞𝐫 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐑𝐨𝐭𝐚𝐫𝐲 𝐏𝐨𝐬𝐢𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐄𝐦𝐛𝐞𝐝𝐝𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u2b88d4b9" id="u2b88d4b9"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1f56b18a" id="u1f56b18a">当前预训练语言模型的自注意力架构本身并不感知位置信息。基于这一认识，研究者提出多种方法，将位置信息引入模型的学习过程</span></strong></p><ul list="u70c840e0"><li fid="u3c944111" data-lake-id="ud220d511" id="ud220d511"><span data-lake-id="u9d58250e" id="u9d58250e">一类方法采用绝对位置编码，将通过预定义函数生成的位置编码或通过训练学习的位置编码加到上下文表示中</span></li><li fid="u3c944111" data-lake-id="u9da300a7" id="u9da300a7"><span data-lake-id="ue59603c3" id="ue59603c3">另一类方法则关注相对位置编码，通常将相对位置信息编码到注意力机制中</span></li><li fid="u3c944111" data-lake-id="u1d336804" id="u1d336804"><span data-lake-id="ud9ac700c" id="ud9ac700c">Liu et al. 提出从神经常微分方程的角度对位置编码的依赖关系进行建模，Wang et al. 则提出在复数空间中对位置信息进行建模。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud5eb66fe" id="ud5eb66fe" style="color: #664900">尽管这些方法取得良好效果，但它们通常以加法形式将位置信息引入上下文表示，因此不适用于线性自注意力架构</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u173f30a3" id="u173f30a3"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubee1faae" id="ubee1faae" style="color: #5C0036">旋转位置编码将位置信息引入预训练语言模型的学习过程。利用旋转矩阵编码绝对位置，同时在自注意力的计算形式中显式引入对相对位置的依赖。其核心思想是通过将上下文表示与旋转矩阵相乘来编码相对位置；RoPE 具有多项有益性质，包括序列长度的灵活性、词元间依赖随相对距离增大而衰减，以及能够为线性自注意力引入相对位置编码</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="Gqd7k" id="Gqd7k" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u7f9dac6b" id="u7f9dac6b">🌿</span><span data-lake-id="ua58915c9" id="ua58915c9"> 𝐑𝐨𝐭𝐚𝐫𝐲 𝐏𝐨𝐬𝐢𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐄𝐦𝐛𝐞𝐝𝐝𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ud82eccdb" id="ud82eccdb"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9d8c8956" id="u9d8c8956">基于 Transformer 的语言建模通常通过自注意力机制利用各个词元的位置信息。</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_m%5E%7B%5C%5Cintercal%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F90a7231c9f84ec964f2e746f4543a35e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gWdVi%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub18b455a" id="ub18b455a">通常用于实现不同位置词元之间的信息传递</span></strong></p><ul list="u24fee5fb"><li fid="u260c1936" data-lake-id="uc5e3bc18" id="uc5e3bc18"><span data-lake-id="ue119a59c" id="ue119a59c">为引入相对位置信息，要求查询向量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7d911300b5aa9ba64ea87dc37e49c5b6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zCDPy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u01d6ceaf" id="u01d6ceaf">与键向量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1d7bc143fde06a7a6505ce4e49d940f8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D1npk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2f514a17" id="u2f514a17">的内积能够由函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7a1e6a754b7a8e45cb731688765c5e85.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ps2Fp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u900bdc49" id="u900bdc49">表示，且该函数仅以词嵌入</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc24b44d601b4c709a58f1c27c994e725.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HoBRA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub9fbb730" id="ub9fbb730">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc81eaa7cb5cfac1a7c0b2f5f7b765a3e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WCSQL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8b59b5a4" id="u8b59b5a4">及其相对位置</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m-n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65672fb269bbc1640e0d76aab4621b03.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EkoT6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc44177ed" id="uc44177ed">作为输入变量。希望内积仅以相对形式编码位置信息</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="udd70bb22" id="udd70bb22" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clangle%20f_q(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m%2Cm)%2Cf_k(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_n%2Cn)%5C%5Crangle%3Dg(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_n%2Cm-n).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B11%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5061712b32a22cb32583fce0212fb052.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PO9MV%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u678e241d"><li fid="uc3b81543" data-lake-id="u4a7c4b56" id="u4a7c4b56"><span data-lake-id="u620dd757" id="u620dd757">最终目标是找到一种等价的编码机制，求得满足上述关系的函数 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_q(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m%2Cm)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1cebfedba2dadee04e1fd72b2996eaf9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cPQtS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf5d7f7da" id="uf5d7f7da"> 和 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_k(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_n%2Cn)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40f24146b85a41111710e0c19ae54907.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22o42Mn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue7d86f0e" id="ue7d86f0e">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ubc4a7553" id="ubc4a7553"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2bb2ebb7" id="u2bb2ebb7">首先考虑维度为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%3D2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffa49f93999c340e970ef9a3cce72868c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hbnov%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9fe85550" id="u9fe85550">的简单情形。在这一设定下，利用二维平面上向量的几何性质及其复数表示，可以证明式（11）的一个解为如下形式</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uce92e6e1" id="uce92e6e1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cnf_q(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m%2Cm)%20%26%3D%20(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D_q%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m)e%5E%7Bim%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cnf_k(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_n%2Cn)%20%26%3D%20(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D_k%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_n)e%5E%7Bin%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cng(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_n%2Cm-n)%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRe%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D_q%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m)(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D_k%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_n)%5E%7B*%7De%5E%7Bi(m-n)%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B12%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F28815b2bd6a23c84e8ff987cfec1e8fc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FMoIe%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uc27fbd37"><li fid="u197d39ed" data-lake-id="uf6fc1c29" id="uf6fc1c29"><span data-lake-id="u4232aadb" id="u4232aadb">​</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRe%7D%5B%5C%5Ccdot%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff5ce11bccd0fd10073f3123691cbc15d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GRYgb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u67a445b1" id="u67a445b1">表示复数的实部，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D_k%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_n)%5E%7B*%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2c72b6de7f50802daf90414eb7734ce2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cr2bi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u46bb928f" id="u46bb928f">表示</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D_k%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_n)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F59b656cd1c29c02c3133e070f3ca25c4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g47gO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u767e9b3a" id="u767e9b3a">的共轭复数，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf2f3940c2a18694b62ebfda493a1194.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22N2esc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua1194a21" id="ua1194a21">为预先设定的非零常数。进一步地，可以将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7B%5C%5C%7Bq%2Ck%5C%5C%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb70958607c9fc3348069b93d71b41f1e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e8zcN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u61fbd252" id="u61fbd252">写成矩阵乘法形式</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uff0513a8" id="uff0513a8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7B%5C%5C%7Bq%2Ck%5C%5C%7D%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m%2Cm)%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bpmatrix%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ccos%20m%5C%5Ctheta%20%26%20-%5C%5Csin%20m%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Csin%20m%5C%5Ctheta%20%26%20%5C%5Ccos%20m%5C%5Ctheta%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bpmatrix%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bpmatrix%7D%5CnW_%7B%5C%5C%7Bq%2Ck%5C%5C%7D%7D%5E%7B(11)%7D%20%26%20W_%7B%5C%5C%7Bq%2Ck%5C%5C%7D%7D%5E%7B(12)%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5CnW_%7B%5C%5C%7Bq%2Ck%5C%5C%7D%7D%5E%7B(21)%7D%20%26%20W_%7B%5C%5C%7Bq%2Ck%5C%5C%7D%7D%5E%7B(22)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bpmatrix%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bpmatrix%7D%5Cnx_m%5E%7B(1)%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cnx_m%5E%7B(2)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bpmatrix%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B13%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5d76d8c8297aa773b01b51efdb491f94.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oVibD%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="udafc1883"><li fid="u2ec5ea0c" data-lake-id="u57a8e5b0" id="u57a8e5b0"><span data-lake-id="u5f46f2c9" id="u5f46f2c9">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(x_m%5E%7B(1)%7D%2Cx_m%5E%7B(2)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F59bfe370a79ee81953e52ab4acc98e23.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22f0nY1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u36ddd781" id="u36ddd781">为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc24b44d601b4c709a58f1c27c994e725.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PoeRG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc028d96c" id="uc028d96c">的二维坐标表示。具体而言，引入相对位置嵌入的方式十分直接：只需将经过仿射变换的词嵌入向量旋转一个与其位置索引成正比的角度</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3e3ce3ba" id="u3e3ce3ba"><strong><span data-lake-id="uac96937d" id="uac96937d">为将二维情形下的结果推广到任意</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_i%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F730fb8e457a914494e4d1a9391e15bc2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kM8TL%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0b5be384" id="u0b5be384">，其中</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56c1b0cb7a48ccf9520b0adb3c8cb2e8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZzHqI%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf5ddbf71" id="uf5ddbf71">为偶数，将</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56c1b0cb7a48ccf9520b0adb3c8cb2e8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XaIgS%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u01caf836" id="u01caf836">维空间划分为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%2F2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F09af116a920e219aaedb978c4feb99d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i7VF9%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ueed860d9" id="ueed860d9">个子空间，再利用内积的线性性质将其组合起来</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u67fcad0a" id="u67fcad0a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7B%5C%5C%7Bq%2Ck%5C%5C%7D%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m%2Cm)%3D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BR%7D_%7B%5C%5CTheta%2Cm%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5C%7Bq%2Ck%5C%5C%7D%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B14%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3da2ca736b721355114877babc6041d0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HFkAT%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uc7a12962" id="uc7a12962" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BR%7D_%7B%5C%5CTheta%2Cm%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bpmatrix%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ccos%20m%5C%5Ctheta_1%20%26%20-%5C%5Csin%20m%5C%5Ctheta_1%20%26%200%20%26%200%20%26%20%5C%5Ccdots%20%26%200%20%26%200%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Csin%20m%5C%5Ctheta_1%20%26%20%5C%5Ccos%20m%5C%5Ctheta_1%20%26%200%20%26%200%20%26%20%5C%5Ccdots%20%26%200%20%26%200%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn0%20%26%200%20%26%20%5C%5Ccos%20m%5C%5Ctheta_2%20%26%20-%5C%5Csin%20m%5C%5Ctheta_2%20%26%20%5C%5Ccdots%20%26%200%20%26%200%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn0%20%26%200%20%26%20%5C%5Csin%20m%5C%5Ctheta_2%20%26%20%5C%5Ccos%20m%5C%5Ctheta_2%20%26%20%5C%5Ccdots%20%26%200%20%26%200%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cvdots%20%26%20%5C%5Cvdots%20%26%20%5C%5Cvdots%20%26%20%5C%5Cvdots%20%26%20%5C%5Cddots%20%26%20%5C%5Cvdots%20%26%20%5C%5Cvdots%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn0%20%26%200%20%26%200%20%26%200%20%26%20%5C%5Ccdots%20%26%20%5C%5Ccos%20m%5C%5Ctheta_%7Bd%2F2%7D%20%26%20-%5C%5Csin%20m%5C%5Ctheta_%7Bd%2F2%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn0%20%26%200%20%26%200%20%26%200%20%26%20%5C%5Ccdots%20%26%20%5C%5Csin%20m%5C%5Ctheta_%7Bd%2F2%7D%20%26%20%5C%5Ccos%20m%5C%5Ctheta_%7Bd%2F2%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bpmatrix%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B15%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb1e75252b2a200350843e4aa476c6780.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fUVUG%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u4a8e9f89"><li fid="ud1c418b7" data-lake-id="u3956e102" id="u3956e102"><span data-lake-id="u178d8495" id="u178d8495">为旋转矩阵，其预定义参数为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CTheta%3D%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Ctheta_i%3D10000%5E%7B-2(i-1)%2Fd%7D%2C%5C%5C%2Ci%5C%5Cin%5B1%2C2%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cd%2F2%5D%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff082a3d6569e6c4d0e9245091c60aa4a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HOCPq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua585f416" id="ua585f416">。将 RoPE 应用于式（2）中的自注意力机制，可得</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u67904326" id="u67904326" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_m%5E%7B%5C%5Cintercal%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_n%3D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BR%7D_%7B%5C%5CTheta%2Cm%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D_q%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m)%5E%7B%5C%5Cintercal%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BR%7D_%7B%5C%5CTheta%2Cn%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D_k%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_n)%3D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cintercal%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D_q%20R_%7B%5C%5CTheta%2Cn-m%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D_k%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_n%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B16%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F893f0a3d3fca0a9c35d7151acbb2385d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Bh6uI%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u6a37c602" id="u6a37c602" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BR%7D_%7B%5C%5CTheta%2Cn-m%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%3D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BR%7D_%7B%5C%5CTheta%2Cm%7D%5E%7Bd%7D)%5E%7B%5C%5Cintercal%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BR%7D_%7B%5C%5CTheta%2Cn%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F31fea9d864a866b5f46a564255abd76e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WM6sC%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uc2b68501"><li fid="u35969d73" data-lake-id="u54a44993" id="u54a44993"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BR%7D_%7B%5C%5CTheta%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0ddbab68b34889da55dda8f244aad449.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z1YpY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3c22cf2a" id="u3c22cf2a">是正交矩阵，这保证位置信息编码过程的稳定性。此外，由于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_%7B%5C%5CTheta%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0f7b9ea7a937f93560b994c25cc67efb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AwUiV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc9db71d2" id="uc9db71d2">具有稀疏性，直接按照式（16）进行矩阵乘法的计算效率并不高</span></li><li fid="u35969d73" data-lake-id="ua958464e" id="ua958464e"><span data-lake-id="ua854f479" id="ua854f479">将 RoPE 应用于自注意力时，可以通过旋转矩阵的乘积自然地引入相对位置信息，而无需修改加性位置编码展开式中的各项</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0ed08144" id="u0ed08144" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790845411784-9ba3dfdf-3955-4688-8d6b-4e017ec2a8b8.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ue12fae39-b1d9-462d-b1b7-70135e90b34%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ua6fc57b7-20f2-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A777.6%2C%22height%22%3A436%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A89173%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A972%2C%22originHeight%22%3A545%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22POSITIONENCODEDQUERY%2FKEY%22%2C%22x%22%3A629%2C%22y%22%3A501%2C%22width%22%3A287%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22POSITIONENCODEDQUERY%2FKEY%22%2C%22x%22%3A730%2C%22y%22%3A157%2C%22width%22%3A225%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ID-2%22%2C%22x%22%3A0%2C%22y%22%3A203%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QUERY%2FKEY%22%2C%22x%22%3A192%2C%22y%22%3A502%2C%22width%22%3A108%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ENHANCED%22%2C%22x%22%3A49%2C%22y%22%3A276%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(X1%2CX2)%22%2C%22x%22%3A137%2C%22y%22%3A110%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EMBEDDING%22%2C%22x%22%3A38%2C%22y%22%3A466%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONSTANT%22%2C%22x%22%3A147%2C%22y%22%3A45%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22POSITION%22%2C%22x%22%3A404%2C%22y%22%3A503%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(X1%2CX2)%22%2C%22x%22%3A791%2C%22y%22%3A125%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRANSFORMER%22%2C%22x%22%3A32%2C%22y%22%3A315%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QUERY%2FKEY%22%2C%22x%22%3A140%2C%22y%22%3A145%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OSITION%22%2C%22x%22%3A67%2C%22y%22%3A429%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROTARY%22%2C%22x%22%3A74%2C%22y%22%3A390%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22POSITIOI%22%2C%22x%22%3A151%2C%22y%22%3A201%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%8B%E4%B8%8B%E5%8F%A3%22%2C%22x%22%3A130%2C%22y%22%3A347%2C%22width%22%3A114%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WITH%22%2C%22x%22%3A81%2C%22y%22%3A352%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NN%22%2C%22x%22%3A158%2C%22y%22%3A177%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f0eeed%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u058fbdfa%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub55b7e13" id="ub55b7e13"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub84ede9e" id="ub84ede9e" style="color: #5C0036">RoPE 与线性注意力：自注意力可以改写为更一般的形式</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u751bef11" id="u751bef11" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BAttention%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D)_m%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csum_%7Bn%3D1%7D%5E%7BN%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsim%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_m%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_n)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bv%7D_n%7D%7B%5C%5Csum_%7Bn%3D1%7D%5E%7BN%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsim%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_m%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_n)%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B17%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1ed259711a1b4545583775f022ca15ed.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tp2Ck%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue42bb467"><li fid="uf4cd298d" data-lake-id="uccc541a6" id="uccc541a6"><span data-lake-id="ue08b13aa" id="ue08b13aa">原始自注意力采用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsim%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_m%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_n)%3D%5C%5Cexp(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_m%5E%7B%5C%5Cintercal%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_n%2F%5C%5Csqrt%7Bd%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbc3917412f7ea4036fdf7f2c2d211f4a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22w67up%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u348e7f6b" id="u348e7f6b">。由于需要为每一对词元计算查询向量与键向量的内积，原始自注意力具有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BO%7D(N%5E2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb3c9f8b141a0bdf0d1f20266f5b13d7c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mwdoR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u30d148f1" id="u30d148f1">的二次复杂度。线性注意力将式（17）改写为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9c7410fe" id="u9c7410fe" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BAttention%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BQ%7D%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BK%7D%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BV%7D)_m%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csum_%7Bn%3D1%7D%5E%7BN%7D%5C%5Cphi(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_m)%5E%7B%5C%5Cintercal%7D%5C%5Cvarphi(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_n)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bv%7D_n%7D%7B%5C%5Csum_%7Bn%3D1%7D%5E%7BN%7D%5C%5Cphi(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_m)%5E%7B%5C%5Cintercal%7D%5C%5Cvarphi(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_n)%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B18%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0efe5adda8a896cca8f5e76c9baf4e5f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i2L53%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u11309822"><li fid="u702ca647" data-lake-id="u645e02e3" id="u645e02e3"><span data-lake-id="u45dd4d09" id="u45dd4d09">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F95d173273e01f4b15cbb1e77cf46caf8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YKN25%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua71a15c4" id="ua71a15c4">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvarphi(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F057128ab9e16f665c8774a96609eadcb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PrluD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1a84e2cb" id="u1a84e2cb">通常为非负函数。Katharopoulos et al.提出采用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi(x)%3D%5C%5Cvarphi(x)%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Belu%7D(x)%2B1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2d81d2d1e50a49e7e4c0f72d92425776.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bkwJU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1d727f90" id="u1d727f90">，并利用矩阵乘法的结合律，先计算键与值之间的乘积。由于 RoPE 通过旋转注入位置信息，并保持隐藏表示的范数不变，因此可以将旋转矩阵与非负函数的输出相乘，从而将 RoPE 与线性注意力结合</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u40875dcc" id="u40875dcc" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BAttention%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D)_m%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csum_%7Bn%3D1%7D%5E%7BN%7D%5C%5Cbig(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BR%7D_%7B%5C%5CTheta%2Cm%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cphi(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_m)%5C%5Cbig)%5E%7B%5C%5Cintercal%7D%5C%5Cbig(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BR%7D_%7B%5C%5CTheta%2Cn%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cvarphi(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_n)%5C%5Cbig)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bv%7D_n%7D%7B%5C%5Csum_%7Bn%3D1%7D%5E%7BN%7D%5C%5Cphi(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_m)%5E%7B%5C%5Cintercal%7D%5C%5Cvarphi(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_n)%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B19%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F868279467db3b4f4246f3f94ce2d3df8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TZkdi%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf7df465c" id="uf7df465c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1760f218" id="u1760f218" style="color: #270070">旋转矩阵乘法的高效实现：利用式（15）中</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BR%7D_%7B%5C%5CTheta%2Cm%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e90e89a51cf43807710278b7dfcd546.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OGImz%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u90dab63f" id="u90dab63f" style="color: #270070">的稀疏性，</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_%7B%5C%5CTheta%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0f7b9ea7a937f93560b994c25cc67efb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22r56wT%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u13892d21" id="u13892d21" style="color: #270070">与</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff544ba7d0dde65f420a7c4a43ff30655.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Mj1k4%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7f3e464c" id="u7f3e464c" style="color: #270070">的乘法可以采用如下计算效率更高的实现方式</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uae1cf268" id="uae1cf268" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BR%7D_%7B%5C%5CTheta%2Cm%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bpmatrix%7D%5Cnx_1%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cnx_2%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cnx_3%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cnx_4%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cvdots%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cnx_%7Bd-1%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cnx_d%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bpmatrix%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cotimes%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bpmatrix%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ccos%20m%5C%5Ctheta_1%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ccos%20m%5C%5Ctheta_1%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ccos%20m%5C%5Ctheta_2%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ccos%20m%5C%5Ctheta_2%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cvdots%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ccos%20m%5C%5Ctheta_%7Bd%2F2%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ccos%20m%5C%5Ctheta_%7Bd%2F2%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bpmatrix%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bpmatrix%7D%5Cn-x_2%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cnx_1%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn-x_4%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cnx_3%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cvdots%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn-x_d%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cnx_%7Bd-1%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bpmatrix%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cotimes%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bpmatrix%7D%5Cn%5C%5Csin%20m%5C%5Ctheta_1%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Csin%20m%5C%5Ctheta_1%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Csin%20m%5C%5Ctheta_2%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Csin%20m%5C%5Ctheta_2%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cvdots%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Csin%20m%5C%5Ctheta_%7Bd%2F2%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Csin%20m%5C%5Ctheta_%7Bd%2F2%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bpmatrix%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B34%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffda2d12c9f0eadb9d5e803bc690fd0a3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22r8HX1%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u2670a709" id="u2670a709"><span data-lake-id="u9f6b21b0" id="u9f6b21b0">RoPE 的长程衰减：可以将向量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D%3D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D_q%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0f58a1cc65570033960566b5c72e7a1a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iS0Lr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2de6eb8d" id="u2de6eb8d">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D%3D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D_k%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F28837446addefa926182299079919f38.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YbmMy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub33d1f49" id="ub33d1f49">中的元素两两分组，从而将式（16）中 RoPE 的内积写成复数乘法形式：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ueb06f81f" id="ueb06f81f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BR%7D_%7B%5C%5CTheta%2Cm%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D_q%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_m)%5E%7B%5C%5Cintercal%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BR%7D_%7B%5C%5CTheta%2Cn%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BW%7D_k%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_n)%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRe%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D0%7D%5E%7Bd%2F2-1%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_%7B%5B2i%3A2i%2B1%5D%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5B2i%3A2i%2B1%5D%7D%5E%7B*%7De%5E%7Bi(m-n)%5C%5Ctheta_i%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B35%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa95735c740cee8d78b1e88bf2243fb71.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22L1eVE%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ubb20c4b8"><li fid="u6dd46158" data-lake-id="uaa8baa9a" id="uaa8baa9a"><span data-lake-id="uadc6f745" id="uadc6f745">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_%7B%5B2i%3A2i%2B1%5D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9bc2ba0e150e7c6ee86bccbef557b5f0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jlVbp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub71875c8" id="ub71875c8">表示</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b4087da586bc7dc75e951a215859d71.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Sggq7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc31e5108" id="uc31e5108">的第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%222i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F502743f1792bdf8c7c4622db537e4059.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22plRcg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u334767df" id="u334767df">至第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%222i%2B1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc34f8016b9e2fbb16985e33fb6b66d0d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22okTEB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u91d179e1" id="u91d179e1">个元素。记</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22h_i%3D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_%7B%5B2i%3A2i%2B1%5D%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5B2i%3A2i%2B1%5D%7D%5E%7B*%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd2cdd57999102ef46bfb34d0519bea5b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vKn8J%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4c3e036b" id="u4c3e036b">，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_j%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D0%7D%5E%7Bj-1%7De%5E%7Bi(m-n)%5C%5Ctheta_i%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Feaa294bc05b73793967e5a7ac207a712.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kwh55%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udd925d8a" id="udd925d8a">，并令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22h_%7Bd%2F2%7D%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff732447ae25dded21e85242d05dae891.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oQ6Ut%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc1d178a3" id="uc1d178a3">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_0%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F52be110c97d82f5753603b4a2908708d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Nfmnt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9b94c91c" id="u9b94c91c">，则可以利用 Abel 变换将上述求和改写为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2ca2e97d" id="u2ca2e97d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D0%7D%5E%7Bd%2F2-1%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_%7B%5B2i%3A2i%2B1%5D%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5B2i%3A2i%2B1%5D%7D%5E%7B*%7De%5E%7Bi(m-n)%5C%5Ctheta_i%7D%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D0%7D%5E%7Bd%2F2-1%7Dh_i(S_%7Bi%2B1%7D-S_i)%3D-%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D0%7D%5E%7Bd%2F2-1%7DS_%7Bi%2B1%7D(h_%7Bi%2B1%7D-h_i).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B36%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F76a5d79f9034350b6f4115fe6e7fc046.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22h4zEA%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf34f148d" id="uf34f148d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%7C%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D0%7D%5E%7Bd%2F2-1%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_%7B%5B2i%3A2i%2B1%5D%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5B2i%3A2i%2B1%5D%7D%5E%7B*%7De%5E%7Bi(m-n)%5C%5Ctheta_i%7D%5C%5Cright%7C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cleft%7C%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D0%7D%5E%7Bd%2F2-1%7DS_%7Bi%2B1%7D(h_%7Bi%2B1%7D-h_i)%5C%5Cright%7C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cleq%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D0%7D%5E%7Bd%2F2-1%7D%7CS_%7Bi%2B1%7D%7C%7C(h_%7Bi%2B1%7D-h_i)%7C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cleq%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmax_i%7Ch_%7Bi%2B1%7D-h_i%7C%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D0%7D%5E%7Bd%2F2-1%7D%7CS_%7Bi%2B1%7D%7C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B37%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4b57b1dbe6d6c4cd2eaf62979b5d91ec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Kmzmu%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u4dbb1f31"><li fid="u870315a8" data-lake-id="ue358469e" id="ue358469e"><span data-lake-id="u17885b99" id="u17885b99">当设置</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta_i%3D10000%5E%7B-2i%2Fd%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8a72d17a728fafa4472d6b9ba549a45b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aBBMI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc50065c4" id="uc50065c4">时，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bd%2F2%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Bd%2F2%7D%7CS_i%7C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffa58c2dae50577bf24fbc8a40d5251fa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ovuhw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua2acb6a8" id="ua2acb6a8">的值会随着相对距离</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m-n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65672fb269bbc1640e0d76aab4621b03.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eYZ3D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9d16789e" id="u9d16789e">的增大而衰减</span></li></ul>